  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO Humanitarian Response Ukraine 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to growing humanitarian needs and the forecasted protraction of the humanitarian crisis in Ukraine, URCS developed their 2023 &#x2013; 2025 One Plan, a multi-year programmatic approach to respond to needs as auxiliary to the Ukrainian government. Red Cross Red Crescent (RCRC) partners operational in Ukraine are expected to provide and/or facilitate the provision of technical and financial support to the One Plan adopting common programmatic approaches, with a view on ensuring sustainable National Society Development (NSD) and simplifying operations.</narrative>
  </description>
